      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[prefetch 6AE58CB3CC84ED5326B24638254A0A9818D4F183.dmg sha1:6AE58CB3CC84ED5326B24638254A0A9818D4F183 size:55347070 https://download.mozilla.org/?product=firefox-latest-ssl&os=osx&lang=en-US sha256:A751F704979ACF234B97D34D4678E399D5CE4926DF185B3410EC1135B7CBB2B5

